---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="Approach — Scott McQueen" description="How Scott McQueen handles metric definitions, automation controls, technical delivery, and AI-assisted development." current="about">
  <header class="page-lead wrap">
    <div class="lead-meta"><p class="eyebrow">Approach / 04</p><span class="mono">Scope / design / delivery</span></div>
    <h1>Understand the problem. Build for the handoff.</h1>
    <p class="lead-text">I start with the business problem, the people affected, and the expected benefit. From there I research the current process, design and build the solution, monitor it, and hand it over with room to improve.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="editorial-section wrap" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Working method</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="method-heading">How I move the work forward.</h2>
        <div class="editorial-copy method-intro">
          <p>First I establish what needs to change for the business and who will use the result. Then I examine the current data and workflow: source fields, report formulas, spreadsheets, and manual steps.</p>
          <p>The design and definitions take shape together. During development I check outputs against source records, monitor the result after release, and work with its owners on the next iteration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="method-sequence" role="group" aria-label="Five steps in my delivery method">
          <div><span class="mono">01</span><strong>Scope</strong><p>Define the problem, people affected, and expected benefit.</p></div>
          <div><span class="mono">02</span><strong>Research and design</strong><p>Analyze the current process and data; design the model and checks.</p></div>
          <div><span class="mono">03</span><strong>Development</strong><p>Build, test, and coordinate dependencies with the teams involved.</p></div>
          <div><span class="mono">04</span><strong>Monitoring</strong><p>Watch output quality and how the solution works in use.</p></div>
          <div><span class="mono">05</span><strong>Handoff and iteration</strong><p>Transfer ownership and adjust as requirements change.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-section wrap" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / Decisions in practice</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="principles-heading">Where I spend the extra time.</h2>
        <div class="record-list principles">
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Platform fit</span><div><h3>Test the target against the workload.</h3><p>Power BI proofs of concept, service stress tests, and query plans exposed constraints in the proposed SAP BusinessObjects migration.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/reporting-modernization/`}>Reporting <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Automation</span><div><h3>Replace thirty manual calculations with a repeatable run.</h3><p>Monthly 401(k) contribution files are aggregated and reconciled automatically; the report shows whether totals balance.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/reconciliation-automation/`}>Automation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Signals</span><div><h3>Show what feeds the status.</h3><p>Intake, milestones, and timing data give a portfolio measure something concrete to stand on.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/portfolio-governance-platform/`}>Portfolio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ai-section" id="ai-method" aria-labelledby="ai-heading">
    <div class="wrap editorial-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / AI-assisted development</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="ai-heading">How AI fits into the build.</h2>
        <div class="editorial-copy">
          <p>I have used Gemini, GitHub Copilot, and Codex to explore implementation options, write code, and look for issues. I set the requirements, choose the architecture, review the changes, and check the behavior.</p>
          <p>Codex assisted with this site's Astro migration, pages, and diagrams. The project descriptions were checked against existing public material and firsthand project details, and the generated routes and assets were tested locally. AI suggestions still need review against the requirements and source claims.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/`}>View the work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .editorial-grid h2{max-width:22ch;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,3.5vw,3.75rem);letter-spacing:-.055em}
  .method-intro{margin-top:1.25rem}
  .method-sequence{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin-top:2.25rem}
  .method-sequence>div{min-height:11rem;padding:1rem .8rem 1rem 0;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .method-sequence>div+div{padding-left:.8rem}.method-sequence>div:last-child{border-right:0}
  .method-sequence .mono{display:block;color:var(--signal);margin-bottom:2.4rem}
  .method-sequence strong{display:block;font-family:'Space Grotesk',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.18rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .method-sequence p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.4rem;line-height:1.35}
  .principles{margin-top:1.75rem}.principles .record-row p{max-width:34rem;margin-top:.6rem;line-height:1.4}
  .principles .action-link{white-space:nowrap}
  .ai-section{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper-light);padding-block:clamp(4rem,6vw,6rem)}
  .ai-section .eyebrow{color:#66d5d7}.ai-section .editorial-copy{margin-top:1.25rem}.ai-section .editorial-copy p{color:#c4d4d9}
  .ai-section .action-link{margin-top:1.8rem;border-color:var(--paper-light)}.ai-section .action-link:hover{color:#66d5d7;border-color:#66d5d7}
  @media(max-width:900px){.method-sequence{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(3){border-right:0}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(n+4){border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(4){padding-left:0}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.method-sequence{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(3){border-right:1px solid var(--rule)}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(even){border-right:0}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.method-sequence>div:nth-child(odd){padding-left:0}.method-sequence .mono{margin-bottom:2rem}.principles .record-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.55rem}.principles .record-row a{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
